{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2023-01-24 06:20:00', 'title': 'LINDE PLC: LINDE BOARD ELECTS HUGH GRANT AS NEW DIRECTOR', 'text': 'WOKING, UK / ACCESSWIRE / JANUARY 24, 2023 / LINDE PLC (NYSE:LIN)(FWB:LIN) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS ELECTED HUGH GRANT AS A NEW DIRECTOR OF LINDE PLC, EFFECTIVE JANUARY 23, 2023. GRANT WILL SERVE ON THE NOMINATION AND GOVERNANCE AND THE HUMAN CAPITAL COMMITTEES.'}